#X text 1200 20 slot_router: REPLACES js_slot_router_stub. Real (2026-08-01), scoped-down from the original slot_router.js -- only prepare/commit/stop/resume survive (the original's other ~25 outlets were 100% karma~ playback and pfft~/gizmo~ pitch/formant control, both deliberately gone from this Pd conversion -- see CONVERSION_NOTES.md). Dispatches by message selector then by stem name (vocals/melody/bass/drums) into 4 slot_router_stem instances, which do the actual per-stem ratio/play/delay logic -- see that abstraction's own doc comments for the commit/resume/delayMs details. 16 outlets total, 4 per stem in the same order (ratio\, play/stop\, delayMs\, delay-start/stop) -- wire each stem's 4 outlets to that stem's stem_timestretch~ instance (outlets 0+1) and its per-stem [delay] object (outlets 2+3) in the parent canvas., f 500;
